>Horton</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Putting clinical trials into context</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>2005</year><volume>366</volume><fpage>107</fpage><lpage>108</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16005318</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0140-6736(05)66846-8</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dietrich</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Barankay</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Hahnel</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Richter</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>High-dose aprotinin in cardiac surgery: three years' experience in 1,784 patients</article-title><source>J Cardiothorac Vasc Anesth</source><year>1992</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>324</fpage><lpage>327</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1377036</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/1053-0770(92)90150-6</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Feit</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Brooks</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name><name><surname>Sopko</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Keller</surname><given-names>NM</given-names></name><name><surname>Rosen</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Krone</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Berger</surname><given-names>PB</given-names></name><name><surname>Shemin</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Attubato</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Williams</surname><given-names>DO</given-names></name><name><surname>Frye</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Detre</surname><given-names>KM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Long-term